{
  "work_id": "wb-glosses/2tim",
  "source_path": "wb-glosses/2tim.json",
  "source_language": "sga",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-01",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.1",
      "source_sha256": "e276b6a1aeceee82",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is not beyond the counsel of God, then"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.2",
      "source_sha256": "5cbcb750e4c222c2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. my deeds do not conflict with my death and my calling"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.3",
      "source_sha256": "5bf8f6fb740d5476",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of all my pupils"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.4",
      "source_sha256": "1950d079db5aacac",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. to God, and to him toward everyone [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.5",
      "source_sha256": "28441bbbdabf9cac",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I pray in many ways, I, with my mouth [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.6",
      "source_sha256": "7a917e0436fdb524",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. since my children and my kindred were engaged in the worship of God, I too, then, am engaged in it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.7",
      "source_sha256": "6229ff7db029b2d7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. prayer to God for you always"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.8",
      "source_sha256": "d90eda4816d60524",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I was sorry that you were separated from me"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.9",
      "source_sha256": "4f418f53d70d368e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. when you stayed behind after me, it was not what you wanted"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.10",
      "source_sha256": "a71bbfa8f8e92a44",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. except that we spoke with each other"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.11",
      "source_sha256": "a75d6a338573c26e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. your grandmother"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.12",
      "source_sha256": "beb6aab1c6b24037",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. that is her name"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.13",
      "source_sha256": "cd31623c7d1e5bf1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. I know that your faith is perfect; it was fitting for you, then, for the faith of your mother and of your grandmother was perfect"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.14",
      "source_sha256": "1546b68710200126",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. I am certain that it is in you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.15",
      "source_sha256": "dfd89890a56ebbfd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. if it has slept a little through fear of tribulation"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.16",
      "source_sha256": "c8b397f0cbafb68b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that we should not be fearful [?] in tribulations"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.17",
      "source_sha256": "9d688cc1a9efa3d8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. that is what he himself suffers"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.18",
      "source_sha256": "7a57faa85c9bfa9d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. do not be ashamed of the preaching of Christ crucified"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.19",
      "source_sha256": "b88e8576216e1f26",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. do not be sorrowful, though I am in prison"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.20",
      "source_sha256": "b11216a9ce877a60",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. both by fulfilling it and by preaching it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.21",
      "source_sha256": "749195aea93365eb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it will not be difficult for you, by the strength of the Holy Spirit"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.22",
      "source_sha256": "2062361e5bb08262",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. because he destined us to be in the unity of the body of Christ"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.23",
      "source_sha256": "a1a4af87f81d7ef5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. after the manner of a provident man who buys land for his children before he has children, so he has bestowed our salvation on us before we existed at all"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.24",
      "source_sha256": "4945b580e971149b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. how life and immortality may be seen"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.25",
      "source_sha256": "b17e006fb9a07605",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. this is death"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.26",
      "source_sha256": "75904a006308fdb7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. because I am the teacher of the Gentiles"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.27",
      "source_sha256": "e57bcc1be0b1edc4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. I am not ashamed, though I suffer"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.28",
      "source_sha256": "0872602cd1806a45",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. he is an ordained person"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.29d.29",
      "source_sha256": "036263aa314d1fd5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is from God that he has done it, and He has kept the deposit (pledge) that is with him; or, it is he who has earned from God the reward that is for him in heaven, and it is God who keeps it for him through his good deeds"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.1",
      "source_sha256": "98abd540dff0152a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. keep them, as you have heard"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.2",
      "source_sha256": "9e615790ae007db0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. which heal body and soul"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.3",
      "source_sha256": "311174f950ea0b33",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. their names are mentioned so that it may be a shame to them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.4",
      "source_sha256": "aabb197bc5454413",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. to his household"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.5",
      "source_sha256": "5bc80c78446f551f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. a fetter in front and a fetter around"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.6",
      "source_sha256": "c8d076b2d3ebdf64",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. he was not ashamed of my friendship, though I was a prisoner"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.7",
      "source_sha256": "c5130f864b20ea41",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. because he was solicitous"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.8",
      "source_sha256": "5fb98996dda804c3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. you know better than I the good he has done me"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.9",
      "source_sha256": "7c86fb8e23bad3a6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. strengthen yourself"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.10",
      "source_sha256": "2e8ea5e8865df596",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. let it not escape you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.11",
      "source_sha256": "f5e7e173e5f73d3f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. those who heard the preaching, and the dead who bore witness: I brought them to confirm my preaching"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.12",
      "source_sha256": "e051bff25fdb5180",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. preach to them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.13",
      "source_sha256": "79a1c00f8c8790f5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they will be faithful through that preaching"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.14",
      "source_sha256": "80281c187c43f2f0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in preaching and in fulfilment"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.15",
      "source_sha256": "a67c3bcbbc4ad2d4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. because you are a good soldier, then"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.16",
      "source_sha256": "d6e0e5cb868ac8e6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "provided only that there be nothing on his conscience"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.17",
      "source_sha256": "a0b9c88020c33d33",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. here, then, he gives the likeness of the soldier of the world"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.18",
      "source_sha256": "8d8d28c0e04c3b2a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. this, then, is 'lawfully': to part from the wealth of the world and to do the will of God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.19",
      "source_sha256": "ab95d641f8f4ae5c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. that you may understand it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.20",
      "source_sha256": "5fe7a00f9fb33a4c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. he answers those who deny the resurrection"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.21",
      "source_sha256": "859cb03c17c998e1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. as I preach it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.22",
      "source_sha256": "2438eb2856da1cd5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. though I be in chains and in prisons"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.23",
      "source_sha256": "720e5052270a3d06",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. though I am in prison and in fetters"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.24",
      "source_sha256": "9f9b29029ae858a7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that they may take an example from me"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.25",
      "source_sha256": "27ab841a25a76da6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. through me in this way"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30a.26",
      "source_sha256": "d8762801adeaeaca",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. salvation, with glory after it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.1",
      "source_sha256": "61521bc9bf0039ea",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in the kingdom"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.2",
      "source_sha256": "addf115bb64c2c60",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in fulfilling what he has promised, i.e. vengeance upon us if we do not believe"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.3",
      "source_sha256": "eac160eef9ddbf32",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. to go into untruth regarding what he has promised"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.4",
      "source_sha256": "6db621921d09215f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. what each one entreats, that it be fulfilled [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.5",
      "source_sha256": "6cb3fd6ec292cf4e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. about contention and questions"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.6",
      "source_sha256": "0c05242f939c9502",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is of no profit to the living [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.7",
      "source_sha256": "37fba441343436e1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. this, however, is good"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.8",
      "source_sha256": "0f8bc3d7a127f1ff",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that you may have no vices"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.9",
      "source_sha256": "f87a6e398f496693",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. a worker"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.10",
      "source_sha256": "5c95927e02fdfb72",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that your deeds do not contradict what you say"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.11",
      "source_sha256": "7dd1199b3def6f92",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. philosophy and dialectic"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.12",
      "source_sha256": "30b9e34788da36f5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they bring nothing else"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.13",
      "source_sha256": "8c17d32c3cf291e0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. like a tumour or an ulcer. Pelagius: Cancer is said to be a wound that arises in the breasts of women; unless it is quickly treated, once the poison, creeping along, has reached the heart, there is no further remedy. So the eloquence of heretics is to be avoided."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.14",
      "source_sha256": "c10474f93f162fb5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. this, according to them, is the resurrection: sons after their fathers, or a people of God worshipping him"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.15",
      "source_sha256": "e7d2b62486c6461d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it has not yet been moved"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.16",
      "source_sha256": "f7d8efe9228d03f7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. of stability; or, knowledge of his household, as he says: 'The Lord knows', etc."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.17",
      "source_sha256": "3084f0cf05d09865",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. a precept of repentance, so that the heretics may not say: 'since it is in contempt of us, we shall not be admitted to repentance'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.18",
      "source_sha256": "bcc8271ba98282ce",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the Lord will decide [?] there"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.19",
      "source_sha256": "8b1ffed07c919f6e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. unless they are cleansed through repentance"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.20",
      "source_sha256": "080437b192849a37",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. youthful"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.21",
      "source_sha256": "f6bd28e72950ea90",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. vainglory and fickleness"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.22",
      "source_sha256": "09a12f71ca0a494f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. that is better"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.23",
      "source_sha256": "253d2502be4b0be3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. as they are peaceable, so that you too may be peaceable; or: peace for you with them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.24",
      "source_sha256": "ba57739904e6cada",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. as heretics and false apostles do"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.25",
      "source_sha256": "633c14c1f202d145",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is for this reason that it is to be avoided"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.26",
      "source_sha256": "5c9420a7fd700c99",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is not fitting for a servant of God to be in contention"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.27",
      "source_sha256": "cef1bcc89b621c12",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. gentle towards everyone, both friend and enemy, as in 'blessed are the meek'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.28",
      "source_sha256": "7e69cab7e2933c58",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. teachable"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.29",
      "source_sha256": "cef7dc7ff0719df0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. for bitterness is not desirable in reproving"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30b.30",
      "source_sha256": "7a8e392c0b2ebef6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. to see whether they will repent"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.1",
      "source_sha256": "9542e7299278ea18",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.2",
      "source_sha256": "f1dfacbb74942547",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. let this be borne in mind"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.3",
      "source_sha256": "69c8417a14a8c4d8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. to body and soul"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.4",
      "source_sha256": "543cea81eac417bf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they love nothing but what is their own will"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.5",
      "source_sha256": "c77d1e0c8116e765",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "towards God and man"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.6",
      "source_sha256": "a9b33c6ef43b2149",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. reviling of everyone"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.7",
      "source_sha256": "945888b07c37b2d3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "about every thing"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.8",
      "source_sha256": "077312181de4cb27",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. fierce towards everyone"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.9",
      "source_sha256": "2ec1c129a030240d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. towards anyone"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.10",
      "source_sha256": "97b7d001c02c8042",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. sullen, secretive [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.11",
      "source_sha256": "84479dd865463bd8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. greater with them is the love of their desire than (the love) of God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.12",
      "source_sha256": "37a30326ca05dc09",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they say that it is the will of God that they teach, and it is not what they do"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.13",
      "source_sha256": "4f015cb3de1e66de",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they pervert everyone through them, for they are skilled at seducing"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.14",
      "source_sha256": "2bef5a624d13d793",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they commit every sin through their seduction"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.15",
      "source_sha256": "7cbdcf848bef2ab4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they will be always learning"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.16",
      "source_sha256": "3aab3b26ee9c4136",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for each resists the other"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.17",
      "source_sha256": "3db8689ec8921bf7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. two Egyptian wizards who were contending against Moses; and the Law does not mention them, but it is from his own tradition, for he was learned in the whole Old Testament"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.18",
      "source_sha256": "8a004fc57fd7ee20",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. their mind is corrupted"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.19",
      "source_sha256": "03458d2164380149",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. their faith is false"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.20",
      "source_sha256": "14446ea84d24aeb7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they will not last longer [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.21",
      "source_sha256": "6202ad889de57d7e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. everyone has known their deeds and their deceptions [?] as they were"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.22",
      "source_sha256": "5d66e4b06b5e4721",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. to take an example from me, from here downwards, all of it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.23",
      "source_sha256": "e98564b1c5617b3f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. *eripiat*. Otherwise: those who desire the will of God must suffer persecution and endurance in the world"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.24",
      "source_sha256": "524974bb35c2672c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. this is *pie vivere* (to live godly)"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.25",
      "source_sha256": "7ac465363dbc7ace",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they will be worse than they were [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.26",
      "source_sha256": "d73433b80e8d5bc2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. their own evils"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30c.27",
      "source_sha256": "8871164d65012a92",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. everyone who consents to them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.1",
      "source_sha256": "d3e3952ccf883a4d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. which has been revealed to patriarchs and prophets and apostles"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.2",
      "source_sha256": "b8ff13fbd489d2d9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "learning of truth"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.3",
      "source_sha256": "2d36ea91c39b745f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I beseech"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.4",
      "source_sha256": "4f968de66b5ae2d4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "*aralaith* [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.5",
      "source_sha256": "41932d83a8fd5132",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that is what is besought there"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.6",
      "source_sha256": "54e83730cad544f0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "whether it is good or bad to whomever it is preached"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.7",
      "source_sha256": "7cf6b8dbe2ebb55c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they will not welcome the teaching that heals bodies and souls"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.8",
      "source_sha256": "f7af050b3316118c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the one they will choose as master is he who tells them their own will"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.9",
      "source_sha256": "8beee74d962475ca",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the hearers [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.10",
      "source_sha256": "e4ba44535267dac1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. to the stories and histories of the Old Testament"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.11",
      "source_sha256": "240da862cf61c15d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the time of my sacrifice has come"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.12",
      "source_sha256": "6594e0ccf5dc6282",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the struggles and boasts of Paul with regard to the last things [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.13",
      "source_sha256": "9fb47e209d72e9c3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. this is what remains: victory and glory for me *pro meo labore* (for my labour)"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.14",
      "source_sha256": "78008224aeb24576",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "i.e. no one's righteousness perishes with him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.15",
      "source_sha256": "ad4a356bcf578638",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "they will be [?] in good works."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.16",
      "source_sha256": "9e1f064116a30f1a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "without separation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.17",
      "source_sha256": "0bef2b4143c71272",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "to come here with you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.18",
      "source_sha256": "bc0068e3716c94d6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "i.e. for preaching."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.19",
      "source_sha256": "16fff244b3bc97e2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "i.e. a 'penbolcc' [?] or a garment, i.e. a tunic or a cloak, i.e. a 'sái' (a kind of garment) or a 'fúan' (a cloak)."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.20",
      "source_sha256": "1964ea0596409240",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "i.e. it is fitting for you not to let him come near you; [?] avoid him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.21",
      "source_sha256": "a8ac02a94980d462",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "i.e. a craftsman who used to make idols of bronze."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.22",
      "source_sha256": "c7af9b1cb02817d0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "i.e. he has done much evil to me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.23",
      "source_sha256": "c6fedbd1fd1c3e24",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "i.e. he wishes evil on evildoers; or, it is not a wish [?] but a prophecy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.30d.24",
      "source_sha256": "5d70d4940121c419",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "let it not abide with you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.31a.1",
      "source_sha256": "64906c3f87335958",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "i.e. at the first preaching, i.e. I defended [?] the gospel even in chains."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.31a.2",
      "source_sha256": "ebd46fac27e2cda2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "i.e. may God forgive them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.31a.3",
      "source_sha256": "39a928dd3dda3de8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "i.e. he will receive me on that day [?]; as he freed me, so may he make me safe."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.31a.4",
      "source_sha256": "eb240fb9764c7e10",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "let their greeting be carried from me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/2tim#Wb.31a.5",
      "source_sha256": "806e8c447c62844e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "for preaching and teaching."
    }
  ]
}
